WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Parallel structure: items joined by and share the same form.. Subject-verb

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
agreement keeps singular and plural in step.. Avoid nested syntax; short clear

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
sentences score higher.. Academic tone prefers obtain over get.. Vary reporting

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
verbs: states, argues, claims.. Time adverbs need the right slot: yet, already,

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
still.. Unless means if not in conditional sentences.. Possession is built with

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
apostrophe s or the word of.. Some verbs take two objects: give, offer, send..

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
Little and few sound negative; a little and a few sound positive..
